This module converts temperatures. It has no tests: a hidden suite checks the behaviour below.

Keep these names and signatures:
- ToCelsius(f float64) int — the existing conversion, truncating toward zero. Its rounding must not
  change: ToCelsius(32)==0, ToCelsius(212)==100, ToCelsius(98.6)==37, ToCelsius(0)==-17.
- ToFahrenheit(c int) float64 — missing: returns c*9/5 + 32 (so 0→32, 100→212, 37→98.6, -17→1.4).

Add what is missing without changing the behaviour that already exists.
